OL,3,CPolice officer 'seriously injured' and
OL,4,C10 arrested after Anfield match
OL,6,FA police officer was "seriously
OL,7,Finjured" and total of 10 people were
OL,8,Farrested during the Liverpool match
OL,9,Fagainst Manchester City.
OL,11,FMerseyside Police said 10 arrests took
OL,12,Fplace at Anfield on October 11,
OL,13,Fincluding one man arrested on
OL,14,Fsuspicion of assaulting an officer.
OL,16,FFive men were arrested during the
OL,17,Fmatch on suspicion of tragedy
OL,18,Fchanting, one on suspicion of being
OL,19,Fdrunk and disorderly and assault, two
OL,20,Ffor affray, and one on suspicion of
OL,21,Fthrowing item onto the pitch.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
