OL,3,CPolice officer 'seriously injured' and
OL,4,C10 arrested after Anfield match
OL,6,FThe away team were berated as "cheats"
OL,7,Fby Liverpool supporters after an
OL,8,Findependent commission ruled City had
OL,9,Fused sham contracts to inject #830
OL,10,Fmillion of inflated income into the
OL,11,Fclub over nine seasons.
OL,13,FThe force said at around 6.35pm, a
OL,14,Fpolice officer sustained a serious
OL,15,Ffacial injury during the arrest of a
OL,16,Fman on Anfield Road. The officer was
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital for treatment and is
OL,18,Fnow recovering at home.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
