OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1793022500
OL,3,CPolice officer 'seriously injured' and
OL,4,C10 arrested after Anfield match
OL,6,FChief Inspector Leanne Hobin said: "As
OL,7,Fwith any fixture, Merseyside Police
OL,8,Fhad a comprehensive policing operation
OL,9,Fin place, having worked alongside the
OL,10,Fclubs and fan groups to ensure the
OL,11,Fgame can be enjoyed by all in a safe
OL,12,Fenvironment.
OL,14,F"Officers were on duty outside the
OL,15,Fground to smoothly facilitate the
OL,16,Fmovements of those travelling to and
OL,17,Ffrom the game, as well as minimise any
OL,18,Fdisruption on the roads outside.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,312,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1793022500
OL,3,CPolice officer 'seriously injured' and
OL,4,C10 arrested after Anfield match
OL,6,F"The officers and stewards are there
OL,7,Fto protect the public and keep them
OL,8,Fsafe, and it is extremely
OL,9,Fdisappointing that an officer has
OL,10,Fsustained a serious injury while
OL,11,Fcarrying out that duty."
OL,13,FOn the subject of tragedy chanting,
OL,14,Fshe added: "The tragic loss of life
OL,15,Fshould never be a subject for tribal
OL,16,Fpoint scoring.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
