PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F311A1793022500
OL,3,CPolice officer 'seriously injured' and
OL,4,C10 arrested after Anfield match
OL,6,F"Football fans who chant about
OL,7,Ftragedies cause huge distress to the
OL,8,Floved ones of people who died and
OL,9,Ftheir behaviour has absolutely no
OL,10,Fplace in football.
OL,12,F"We will continue to work with clubs
OL,13,Fto take action to identify any
OL,14,Fperpetrators and bring them to
OL,15,Fjustice."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/5
